scn 1
# AR-03 structsquad: 20 movers and one 4x4 structure in formation Alt+1; the movers are ordered 130 cells east.
# FormAgg takes the slowest member's baseSpeed over the squad and a structure's is 0, so the formation paces
# every mover to a creep: on b8a4110 and on the W2 head 0/20 arrive (mean x 21 cells after 3000 ticks).
# Target (PLAN 3.4 AR-03): 20/20 by 1350 (the same 20 without the structure arrive by tick 1299; Retail with the
# structure in its group is paced too: done 2990 against 1358 without).
# Source: the audit's probe_structsquad (legion_world_test), as a scenario.
name structsquad
ticks 1500
seed 7
map flat 200 80
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
type house structure 4 4
group A 0 m 20 cells 14,30 17,30 20,30 23,30 26,30 14,34 17,34 20,34 23,34 26,34 14,38 17,38 20,38 23,38 26,38 14,42 17,42 20,42 23,42 26,42 squad=f1
group H 0 house 1 cells 40,50 squad=f1
region goal 140 30 160 52
at 1 move A 150 40
